Our schedule includes a visit to the city of London, Buckingham Palace, Westminster Abbey and Trafalgar Square with its famous Nelson Column. Of course, there are also a lot of other places to see in London.
I'm looking forward to seeing the changing of the guard.
It's a very fine day today. so you'll be able to take many great color pictures.
